# 🎨 2. UI / UX Consistency Rules (VERY IMPORTANT)

UI consistency is mandatory.

Global styles are defined in:

packages/ui/src/styles/globals.css

Before:
- Adding new colors
- Adding spacing values
- Adding typography styles
- Creating new button variants
- Creating new layout patterns

→ ALWAYS check globals.css first.

Do not introduce:
- Random Tailwind values
- Inline hardcoded colors
- Arbitrary spacing
- New font sizes outside system

Follow existing:
- Color palette
- Radius scale
- Shadow system
- Spacing rhythm
- Typography hierarchy

If a new design token is required:
- It must be added to globals.css
- It must follow the existing naming convention

