# 🧩 3. Component Design Standards

All UI components must:

- Be composable
- Be accessible (ARIA when necessary)
- Support dark mode if applicable
- Avoid inline styles
- Avoid magic numbers
- Use design tokens
- Be responsive by default

Never duplicate components.

If extending behavior:
- Prefer composition over modification
- Avoid breaking existing API

