# 🎯 Main Principle

This is a clean architecture monorepo.

Every layer has a responsibility.
Every package has a boundary.
UI must be consistent.
No shortcuts.

If unsure where something belongs:
→ Prefer domain separation over convenience.

Clean architecture > speed.
Long-term maintainability > short-term hacks.

